        <description>&lt;img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1729188430325-eb540fcdd941?ixid=M3w0NjAwMjJ8MHwxfHJhbmRvbXx8fHx8fHx8fDE3ODc3MzEyOTF8&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0" alt="Featured image of post claude-plugins-community" /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;anthropicsclaude-plugins-community&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-community&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;anthropics/claude-plugins-community&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;claude-plugins--community&#34;&gt;Claude Plugins — Community
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Community-contributed plugins for &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://claude.com/product/cowork&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Claude Cowork&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://claude.com/product/claude-code&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;what-this-repo-is&#34;&gt;What this repo is
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;read-only mirror&lt;/strong&gt; of the community plugin marketplace. The &lt;code&gt;.claude-plugin/marketplace.json&lt;/code&gt; file here is the list of community plugins available to install. It is synced nightly from Anthropic&amp;rsquo;s internal review pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every plugin listed here has been submitted via &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://clau.de/plugin-directory-submission&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;claude.ai&lt;/a&gt;, passed automated security scanning, and been approved for distribution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;using-this-marketplace&#34;&gt;Using this marketplace
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;claude-cowork&#34;&gt;Claude Cowork
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Install plugins from &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://claude.com/plugins/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;claude.com/plugins&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;claude-code&#34;&gt;Claude Code
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;claude plugin marketplace add anthropics/claude-plugins-community
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;claude plugin install &amp;lt;plugin-name&amp;gt;@claude-community
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;submitting-a-plugin&#34;&gt;Submitting a plugin
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Submit via &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://clau.de/plugin-directory-submission&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;clau.de/plugin-directory-submission&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;. Pull requests opened directly against this repo are closed automatically — all changes flow from the internal review pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;related&#34;&gt;Related
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;anthropics/claude-plugins-official&lt;/a&gt; — Anthropic-maintained plugins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins&lt;/a&gt; — role-specific knowledge-work plugins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
